return {
    ["       梅丽莎微皱眉头道：\n       “为什么要坐公共马车？到学校得4个便士，来回就是8便士，算上你和班森，我们一天就要在公共马车上花费24便士，整整2苏勒，一周，嗯，不算周日，就是12苏勒，略等于我们的房租了！”\n       停停停，不要炫耀你的数学水平……克莱恩好笑地压了下手。\n       梅丽莎先是停顿，接着又补充了一句：\n       “我走路去学校挺好的，老师说每个人都要经常锻炼，而且我还能在路上捡到一些破损的零件。”\n\n       ——第一卷《小丑》第三十九章 有趣的技巧"] = "Melissa frowned slightly and said: \n “Why take a public carriage? It costs 4 pence to get to school, 8 pence for a round trip. Counting you and Benson, we would spend 24 pence on public carriages a day, a full 2 Soles. A week, well, not counting Sunday, is 12 Soles, which is slightly equal to our rent!” \n Stop, stop, stop, don’t show off your math skills… Klein pressed his hand down amusedly. \n Melissa paused first, then added: \n “I think it’s fine to walk to school. The teacher said everyone should exercise frequently, and I can pick up some damaged parts on the way.” \n \n —— Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 39: Interesting Technique",
    ["%s超越了%d%%的非凡者，勇士之心，虽死犹荣。"] = "%s surpassed %d%% of Beyonders. Heart of a warrior, glorious even in death.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【亡者疑踪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法类型：</><Assistant_Property1>黑荆棘事件簿</>\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>非凡者在<Assistant_Property1>53级</>后，点击<Assistant_System>菜单-世界冒险-副本-黑荆棘事件簿-亡者疑踪</>参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与人数：</>5~6人组队，或选择人机模式前往。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法奖励：</>60装等金色装备、非凡物质等。每日1次奖励次数<Assistant_Red>（黑荆棘事件簿共享奖励次数）</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>首领攻略：</>{JumpToUI:[亚巴顿]|1302138}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Traces of the Dead】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Blackthorn Incident Log</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method: </>Beyonders who have reached <Assistant_Property1>Level 53</> can participate by clicking <Assistant_System>Menu-World Adventure-Dungeon-Blackthorn Incident Log-Traces of the Dead</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Number of Participants: </>5~6 player party, or choose AI mode.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rewards: </>Level 60 Gold Equipment, Extraordinary materials, etc. 1 reward count per day <Assistant_Red>(shared reward count for Blackthorn Incident Log)</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Boss Strategy: </>{JumpToUI:[Abaddon]|1302138}",
