    ["·隐秘羁绊最高等级为7级。达到满级后，溢出的好感度将按照10:1的比例自动折算为【记忆珍匣】，可在【往事陈列馆】商店处兑换各类外观。\n·非凡者与人脉一同参与漫步、邀约、共舞等互动时可消耗【漫忆请柬】并获得好感度。每日首次与人脉互动不消耗邀请券，所有人脉共享该免费次数。\n·与同一人脉进行同一类型互动并邀请券后，当日内再次进行该类型互动将不再消耗邀请券，也不再获得好感度。\n·漫步：仅限大世界场景使用，进入副本等非大世界场景后将自动解除。\n·非凡者与对应人脉角色好感度等级达到2级后，每日可获得2次与该人脉的邀约函集次数（次数随着好感度等级增加），消耗邀约函集次数与对应数量的【漫忆请柬】，非凡者直接完成对应的快速互动次数，直接获得该人脉对应的好感度以及奖励。\n·非凡者每日还可获得5次全人脉共享的邀约函集次数，最高累计15次（全人脉角色共享），但是需要非凡者解锁【愚者福音】才可使用该邀约函集次数。\n·非凡者与人脉角色快速互动时，优先消耗人脉本身的邀约函集次数，再消耗全人脉共享的次数。"] = "· The maximum level for Secret Bonds is 7. Upon reaching the maximum level, excess favorability will be automatically converted into [Memory Caskets] at a 10:1 ratio, which can be exchanged for various appearances at the [Past Exhibition Hall] shop. \n · When Beyonders participate in interactions such as strolling, inviting, or dancing with contacts, they can consume [Memory Invitations] and gain favorability. The first interaction with a contact each day does not consume an invitation ticket; this free attempt is shared among all contacts. \n · After interacting with the same contact in the same way and using an invitation ticket, subsequent interactions of the same type on the same day will not consume invitation tickets, nor will they grant favorability. \n · Strolling: Only available in the open world; it will be automatically canceled upon entering dungeons or other non-open-world scenes. \n · Once the favorability level between a Beyonder and a corresponding contact reaches level 2, you can obtain 2 invitation collection attempts for that contact daily (the number of attempts increases with the favorability level). Consuming these attempts and the corresponding number of [Memory Invitations] allows the Beyonder to directly complete the corresponding quick interaction and obtain the contact's favorability and rewards. \n · Beyonders can also obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Beyonder to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Beyonder performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
    ["　　近期，廷根<Highlight>离奇案件频繁发生</>。\n　　一位市民声称头顶长出红色蘑菇。一位富豪家中花房内的花藤疯狂生长，将他勒死在镶金的马桶上……\n　　警方提示，怪异传闻，多为幻觉。如遇此类事件，请立刻报警，或就近前往教堂求助。"] = "Recently, <Highlight> bizarre cases have occurred frequently </> in Tingen. \n A citizen claimed that red mushrooms grew on their head. The vines in a wealthy man's conservatory grew wildly, strangling him on his gold-inlaid toilet... \n The police remind citizens that strange rumors are mostly hallucinations. If you encounter such events, please call the police immediately or go to the nearest church for help.",
